    "text": "By Eric F. Epler ,\n1 days ago The secret is out on the Northern Polar Bears. Preseason predictions had Jeff Costello’s crew perched near the bottom of the Mid-Penn Keystone Division. And while plenty of new, full-time starters have dug in, Costello’s returning cast have the folks in Dillsburg buzzing heading into the midpoint of the regular season. Read full article\n1",
